  "interpretation": "<ul>\n<li data-start=\"1500\" data-end=\"1593\">\n<p data-start=\"1502\" data-end=\"1593\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">The <strong data-start=\"1506\" data-end=\"1524\">second opinion</strong> is based on review of <strong data-start=\"1547\" data-end=\"1590\">submitted slides and/or paraffin blocks</strong>.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 12px;\" data-start=\"1594\" data-end=\"1688\">\n<p data-start=\"1596\" data-end=\"1688\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Additional stains or molecular tests (IHC, PCR, NGS) may be requested for final diagnosis.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 12px;\" data-start=\"1689\" data-end=\"1877\">\n<p data-start=\"1691\" data-end=\"1729\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">The final report will clearly state:</span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1732\" data-end=\"1877\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 12px;\" data-start=\"1732\" data-end=\"1795\">\n<p data-start=\"1734\" data-end=\"1795\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Whether the <strong data-start=\"1746\" data-end=\"1792\">original diagnosis is confirmed or revised</strong>.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 12px;\" data-start=\"1798\" data-end=\"1877\">\n<p data-start=\"1800\" data-end=\"1877\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Any <strong data-start=\"1804\" data-end=\"1834\">new differential diagnosis</strong> or <strong data-start=\"1838\" data-end=\"1876\">recommendations for further workup</strong>.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>",
